{
  "results": [
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:2914",
        "text": "Users demand seamless, mobile-first, personalized financial experiences integrated into their daily platforms—creating a prime opportunity for businesses to embed financial products, unlock new revenue streams, and dramatically boost customer lifetime value."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:2919",
        "text": "Building a branded Neobank comes with major hurdles, including navigating complex regulations, hiring specialized engineering talent, constructing secure financial infrastructure, and managing a slow go-to-market timeline."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:2989",
        "text": "We operate in a rapidly expanding market. The global digital banking sector is projected to grow at a 10% CAGR, surpassing $1.7 trillion by 2026, creating a massive opportunity for innovation."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:2992",
        "text": "The digital banking user base is exploding—by 2024, users are set to exceed 3.6 billion, a 54% increase from 2020."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3042",
        "text": "In just a few years, we've grown from a bold idea into a platform trusted by millions, processing over $3.7 billion in payments monthly across borders and currencies. With a 4.9 app rating, 92% referral likelihood, and relentless focus on infrastructure, security, and simplicity, every transaction happens instantly and without friction."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3055",
        "text": "Engineered for high availability and global scale, our platform uses redundant architecture and enterprise-grade SLAs to ensure stability even during peak loads or regional outages."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3062",
        "text": "Operate in 30+ markets with full localization, multi-currency support, and built-in regulatory compliance, eliminating barriers to international growth and simplifying cross-border payments."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3069",
        "text": "Transactions process in milliseconds with instant feedback and intuitive flows, delivering an effortless, familiar user experience across both web and mobile."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3076",
        "text": "No-code workflows and powerful APIs let you automate complex payment logic—from dynamic routing to event-driven triggers—without writing custom backend code."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3083",
        "text": "Security is foundational, not an afterthought—from KYC to anti-fraud systems and end-to-end encryption, we meet or exceed industry standards to keep data and money safe."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3134",
        "text": "The past ten months have seen significant acceleration, with key platform metrics up over 150% year-over-year. New partner acquisition grew 45% quarter-over-quarter, reflecting strong market trust in our technology as the foundational infrastructure for launching financial products."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:3135",
        "text": "Existing partners are thriving too—transaction volume from this cohort surged over 300%, driving our net dollar retention to an industry-leading 140% and creating a powerful network effect that fuels sustainable, long-term growth."
      }
    }
  ],
  "total": 12,
  "succeeded": 12
}

